WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.715
A payment can succeed, yet the settlement still doesn't match.
What happens next?

00:00:04.715 --> 00:00:09.894
I built FireOPS Lab to explore that question.
Follow a fictional payment batch from processing through reconciliation.

00:00:09.894 --> 00:00:14.363
Spot an exception, trace the records,
investigate the cause and document a decision.

00:00:14.363 --> 00:00:20.370
Then review monitoring alerts, audit trails
and operational insights.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:27.903
Every transaction is synthetic, but the workflow
reflects the discipline of real operations.

00:00:27.903 --> 00:00:32.272
I'm Shaik Arham.

00:00:32.272 --> 00:00:42.597
My background in business intelligence, SQL, data validation
and production incident support taught me to follow evidence, not assumptions.

00:00:42.597 --> 00:00:46.975
That's the approach I'd bring to the Operations Analyst
team at Fire.com.

00:00:46.975 --> 00:00:50.200
Explore the interactive project and its source code.
